Subject: [PATCH] Redesign portfolio: editorial layout with infinite marquees
 and parallax

Replace the old multi-page neon theme with a single-page dark editorial
design: parallax hero, velocity-reactive infinite marquees, parallax
project showcase, scroll-revealed about text, experience timeline,
contact form (posts to /api/contact) and a marquee footer.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
